   "id": 505177,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>Correctly apply the rules for the order of operations to accurately compute the following:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"8-(25-{2^2})/7\">8-(25-{2^2})/7</span>.</p>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"8-\\left({25-{2^2}} \\right)/7\"></span></p>\n<p>Use PEMDAS.</p>\n<p>Evaluate the operations inside the parentheses first.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Calculate the exponent.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"8-\\left({25-4} \\right)/7\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Subtract inside the parentheses.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"8-\\left({21} \\right)/7\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divide by 7.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"8-3\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Subtract.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"5\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "5"
    }
   ],
